<title>USA: Central City, Ky., won by J.J.B Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Central City, Ky., won by J.J.B Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.J.B Hilliard, W.L. Lyons, Inc. said it won $1.070 million of Central City, Ky., water and sewer refunding revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.404 percent.</p>
</text>
